# First Prompt

**Course:** AI Agents and Agentic AI with Python & Generative AI (Coursera)

## Objective

Programmatically send prompts to an LLM using LiteLLM and Gemini, then build a multi-step workflow that generates, documents, and tests Python code.

## Environment

- Platform: Google Colab
- Language: Python
- LLM Interface: LiteLLM
- Model: Gemini

